# Observability

Full detail: `docs/architecture/observability.md`.

## Logs

- pino via Fastify, JSON to stdout. `request.log` inside requests, `app.log` for lifecycle only.
- Standard field names: `request_id`, `project_id`, `flag_key`, `reason`, `duration_ms`.
- Levels: `error` 5xx/unexpected · `warn` degraded deps · `info` request completed, mutation
  committed, 4xx · `debug` cache hit/miss, per-flag decisions.
- Never log: raw keys, key hashes, `Authorization`/`X-Api-Key`, request/response bodies,
  `user.attrs`. `user.id` only at `debug`.
- Rate-limit repeated degraded-dependency warnings (1 per 10s per dependency).

## Metrics

- Prefix `semaphore_`, base units in names, counters end `_total`.
- Required: `semaphore_evaluate_total{reason}`, `semaphore_evaluate_duration_seconds`,
  `semaphore_admin_mutations_total{action}`.
- Labels only from closed enums. Never label by flag key, project id or user id.

## Health

- `/healthz` liveness, no dependency calls. `/readyz` Postgres only. `/healthz/deps` detail
  incl. Redis. Redis never affects readiness.
